m/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122220","id":5236464487,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOB4bZw","user":{"login":"brohd11","id":167618859,"node_id":"U_kgDOCf2pKw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167618859?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11","html_url":"https://github.com/brohd11","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T06:01:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T06:01:16Z","body":"Nice find, thanks!\n\nThe rationale of removing it does make sense to me. Extending an inner class really makes no sense at all. The const extension doesn't either, it was really only a side effect of my second example above stopping working. I started a discussion in the discussions area about that issue but never really got any meaninful engagement\n\nHopefully one of these methods will be viable for plugin makers and just for general organization. It's the closest thing we have to namespaces right now. Much nicer to work with vs needing to use paths or uids in the extends\n\n```gdscript\nextends MyPlugin.MyClass\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5236464487/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5237178341","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122220#issuecomment-5237178341","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122220","id":5237178341,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOCj_5Q","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T07:30:48Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T07:31:17Z","body":"Seems like you can use string relative path directly in `extends \"Base.gd\"`. Tbh never used it, so I'm not sure what guarantees this method has.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5237178341/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5238968502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122220#issuecomment-5238968502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122220","id":5238968502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOERQtg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T10:29:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T10:29:16Z","body":"CC @HolonProduction ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5238968502/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5238973105","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122220#issuecomment-5238973105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122220","id":5238973105,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOERisQ","user":{"login":"brohd11","id":167618859,"node_id":"U_kgDOCf2pKw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/167618859?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11","html_url":"https://github.com/brohd11","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brohd11/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T10:29:45Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T10:33:28Z","body":"Yes you can extend with paths but it's a step back in usability when a class with preloads can give you autocomplete and a single path/uid to maintain\n\nHere was my original post from when I first ran into this issue if anyone's interested. This was more of a discussion about what data a script's property list should store, but the first half or so lays out where the issue is when extending from a global classes member:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/14078\n\n**TLDR:**\nWhen extending from a preloaded class that lives in the global class, the \"base\" field in project settings global class list is empty. Storing it in the const gives that field the const name. not the proper value, but it stopped the errors from populating. Note, this applies if you try to use an inner class to extend from as well\n\n If the base field was instead resolved to the actual extended script's base type, (which we must have, this does compile)\n`class_name MyClass extends GlobalClass.MyClassBase` works with no errors again\n\nI would say this is the actual gap, not the extending from the member const in retrospect 😅\n\n---\n\njust spent a few minutes tracking this to: GDScriptLanguage::_get_global_class_name\n\nso the analyzer can't be used here per the comments\n```\n\t/* **WARNING**\n\t *\n\t * This function is written with the goal to be *extremely* error tolerant, as such\n\t * it should meet the following requirements:\n\t *\n\t * - It must not rely on the analyzer (in fact, the analyzer must not be used here),\n\t *   because at the time global classes are parsed, the dependencies may not be present\n\t *   yet, hence the function will fail (which is unintended).\n\t * - It must not fail even if the parsing fails, because even if the file is broken,\n\t *   it should attempt its best to retrieve the inheritance metadata.\n\t *\n\t * Before changing this function, please ask the current maintainer of EditorFileSystem.\n\t */\n```\nMakes me question the empty base field error being thrown, if valid gdscript can compile without it, should it throw an error? (wasn't before 4.6)\n\nI don't know the answer, I just want to use the closest thing we have to namespaces right now 😅","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5238973105/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5239464303","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122220#issuecomment-5239464303","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122220","id":5239464303,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOEvhbw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T11:22:36Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T11:22:36Z","body":"Ignore the error, it comes from editor code that tries to fetch an icon based on the empty base field. The GDScript compiler does fully support this.\n\nThe base field is only relevant to the editor. At some point folks wanted more info on scripts and just added it to some existing API and didn't notice that they created an interface that can't reasonably be implemented correctly. It asks for inheritance info at a point in time were not all global classes are known.\n\nA proper solution would move all the editor fuzz into a dedicated cache and split aquisition into one pass for name+path and a second pass for editor fuzz that can use the analyzer.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5239464303/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]